[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14821.189, "timestamp": "04:07:01", "text": "盖章后会写上我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14823.429, "timestamp": "04:07:03", "text": "为了这个目的，也要进行录制。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14826.229, "timestamp": "04:07:06", "text": "为了工作，所以它被正确地写入。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14829.67, "timestamp": "04:07:09", "text": "已写入文件，还有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14831.99, "timestamp": "04:07:11", "text": "第二种方法类似于用户时间戳。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14833.595, "timestamp": "04:07:13", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "crazy stuff"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14833.83, "timestamp": "04:07:13", "text": "这样聊天室里的人就可以点赞了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14835.51, "timestamp": "04:07:15", "text": "感叹号"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14838.07, "timestamp": "04:07:18", "text": "就像他们发现的那样，标记这条溪流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14840.389, "timestamp": "04:07:20", "text": "任何可夹住或适合……的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14843.91, "timestamp": "04:07:23", "text": "他们可以通过添加时间戳来标记它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14847.189, "timestamp": "04:07:27", "text": "是的。我的做法是，呃，我得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14850.55, "timestamp": "04:07:30", "text": "整个 CSV 文件，就像所有这些东西一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14853.51, "timestamp": "04:07:33", "text": "我把所有时间戳都放进了 Notion 里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14856.389, "timestamp": "04:07:36", "text": "从概念到网站，就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14859.429, "timestamp": "04:07:39", "text": "这样人们就可以阅读摘要了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14863.429, "timestamp": "04:07:43", "text": "不管我，不管我们做了什么，还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14866.63, "timestamp": "04:07:46", "text": "从 YouTube 获取时间戳"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14869.91, "timestamp": "04:07:49", "text": "由于您的 Twitch 过期，请返回查看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14872.07, "timestamp": "04:07:52", "text": "它。是的，他们可以点击它，然后你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14874.63, "timestamp": "04:07:54", "text": "捕捉到最精准的瞬间。我这样做是为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14878.15, "timestamp": "04:07:58", "text": "比利比利也是，所以现在更容易了。"}]